sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Settings Billing
  participant API as /api/billing
  participant RZ as Razorpay
  participant DB as billing_orders

  U->>FE: Choose Pro or Business
  FE->>API: POST /billing/orders
  API->>RZ: Create order
  RZ-->>API: order_id
  API->>DB: Save created order
  API-->>FE: key and orderId
  FE->>RZ: Open Checkout
  U->>RZ: Pay
  RZ-->>API: Webhook with signature
  API->>API: Verify HMAC
  API->>DB: Mark paid and update plan
